# Lerne Deutsch — Cursor Rules

This is a German language learning app called "Lerne Deutsch". It is a TypeScript
Expo React Native app targeting web (and potentially mobile later). Read these rules
carefully before writing any code — they describe the exact patterns already in use.

---

## Tech Stack

- **Expo** with **Expo Router** (file-based routing, drawer layout)
- **TypeScript** throughout — no plain JS files
- **React Native** components (View, Text, TouchableOpacity, ScrollView, StyleSheet)
- **Zustand** for global state (level, auth, tips)
- **Supabase** (@supabase/supabase-js) for auth and database
- **Google Gemini API** (@google/generative-ai) for AI features — model `gemini-2.5-flash`
- **Feather icons** via `@expo/vector-icons` — used for all icons, no emojis anywhere
- **IBM Plex Mono** and **Inter** fonts via `@expo-google-fonts`

---

## Project Structure

```
app/                        — Expo Router screen files (one file = one route)
  _layout.tsx               — Root layout: drawer nav, auth gate, font loading, TipsBar
  index.tsx                 — Home / Dashboard
  flashcards.tsx
  games.tsx
  grammar.tsx
  daily.tsx
  exam.tsx
  progress.tsx
  insights.tsx
  reading.tsx
  pronunciation.tsx

src/
  components/               — Reusable UI components
    AuthScreen.tsx
    ExerciseCard.tsx
    FlashCard.tsx
    LevelToggle.tsx
    TipsBar.tsx
    exam/                   — Exam Prep sub-components
    games/                  — Mini Game sub-components

  data/                     — Static content (no API calls here)
    vocabulary/
      types.ts              — Word and related types
      a1.ts, a2.ts, b1.ts, b2.ts
      index.ts              — VOCABULARY: Record<Level, Word[]>
    grammar/
      types.ts              — GrammarExercise and related types
      a1.ts, a2.ts, b1.ts
      index.ts              — GRAMMAR: Record<Level, GrammarExercise[]>
    passages.ts             — Reading Mode passages
    sentenceBuilder.ts      — Sentence Builder sentences, Record<Level, SentenceEntry[]>
    tips.ts                 — Tips list
    topicTipMap.ts          — Grammar topic → tip mapping
    pronunciationGuide.ts

  lib/                      — Services and utilities
    supabase.ts             — Supabase client (single instance)
    gemini.ts               — ALL Gemini calls live here, nowhere else
    authService.ts
    levelService.ts
    scoresService.ts
    masteryService.ts
    mistakeService.ts
    streakService.ts
    activityService.ts
    grammarTopicService.ts
    contextualTipService.ts
    userId.ts               — getUserId() helper
    dateUtils.ts            — toDateString, getTodayString, etc.

  store/                    — Zustand stores
    useAuthStore.ts         — session, user, userId
    useLevelStore.ts        — level (A1/A2/B1/B2), setLevel, nextLevel
    useTipStore.ts          — contextual tip state

  styles/
    theme.ts                — Single source of truth for all design tokens

scripts/                    — One-off data processing scripts (Node.js)
```

