## Design System

Import everything from `src/styles/theme.ts`. Never hardcode colors, font names, or
spacing values inline — always reference theme constants.

### Colors (from `colors` in theme.ts)

```
colors.background    #fafafa   — page background
colors.surface       #ffffff   — card background
colors.surfaceAlt    #f5f5f5   — nested surfaces
colors.border        #e0e0e0   — card and input borders
colors.borderStrong  #bbbbbb   — focused input border
colors.textPrimary   #111111   — headings, body text
colors.textSecondary #888888   — labels, hints
colors.textMuted     #aaaaaa   — placeholders, disabled
colors.accent        #2563eb   — blue, interactive / selected
colors.accentLight   #eff6ff   — blue tint background
colors.success       #16a34a   — correct, green
colors.successLight  #f0fdf4
colors.error         #dc2626   — wrong, red
colors.errorLight    #fef2f2
colors.amber         #f59e0b   — shaky/warning
colors.amberLight    #fffbeb
colors.sidebar       #1a1a2e   — dark navy sidebar and topbar
colors.sidebarText   #ffffff
```

### Fonts (from `font` in theme.ts)

- **IBM Plex Mono** — used for ALL content: German words, exercises, scores, numbers, body text, headings
  - `font.regular`  = `IBMPlexMono_400Regular`
  - `font.medium`   = `IBMPlexMono_500Medium`
  - `font.semiBold` = `IBMPlexMono_600SemiBold`
  - `font.bold`     = `IBMPlexMono_700Bold`
- **Inter** — used ONLY in sidebar and topbar navigation
  - `Inter_400Regular`, `Inter_500Medium`, `Inter_600SemiBold`

Never use Inter outside the sidebar/topbar. Never use IBM Plex Mono in sidebar/topbar labels.

### Font sizes (from `fontSize`)

```
fontSize.xxs  10   micro labels
fontSize.xs   11   ALL CAPS labels
fontSize.sm   13   secondary body
fontSize.md   15   primary body
fontSize.lg   17   card titles
fontSize.xl   20   section headings
fontSize.xxl  28   big stat numbers
fontSize.xxxl 36   hero numbers
```

### Spacing (from `spacing`)

```
spacing.xs   4
spacing.sm   8
spacing.md   12
spacing.lg   16
spacing.xl   20
spacing.xxl  24
spacing.xxxl 32
spacing.hero 48
```

### Border radius (from `radius`)

```
radius.sm  2
radius.md  4   ← standard card radius
radius.lg  8
radius.xl  12
```

### Pre-built style objects (import and use directly)

- `cardStyle` — white bg, 1px border, 4px radius, 24px padding
- `labelStyle` — ALL CAPS, 11px, letterSpacing 0.9, textSecondary
- `primaryButtonStyle` — dark fill (#1a1a2e), 4px radius
- `secondaryButtonStyle` — outlined, no fill, 1px border
- `ghostButtonStyle` — no border, no fill (back/skip links)
- `inputStyle` — white, 1px border, 4px radius, IBM Plex Mono
- `statNumberStyle` — bold, 28px, IBM Plex Mono
- `progressTrackStyle` — thin 3px track for progress bars

### Rules

- No shadows anywhere (shadowOpacity: 0, elevation: 0)
- No gradients
- Cards: 1px border (#e0e0e0), 4px radius, white bg
- Labels are ALL CAPS in IBM Plex Mono SemiBold at 11px
- Scores display as "X / Y" where Y is grey (textSecondary)
- No emojis anywhere in the UI — use Feather icons only

